      en: ["Founded in 1523 by Spanish officer García de Holguín.", "Ranked as the fourth-largest city in Cuba.", "Loma de la Cruz hill features a 458-step staircase.", "Columbus first landed nearby on October 27, 1492.", "Home to the major Bucanero and Mayabe breweries.", "Famous for the annual Romerías de Mayo festival."],
