      en: ["Largest wetland in the Caribbean region", "UNESCO Biosphere Reserve", "Primary habitat for the endemic Cuban crocodile", "Critical stopover for migratory bird species"],
      es: ["El humedal más grande del Caribe", "Reserva de la Biosfera de la UNESCO", "Hogar del cocodrilo cubano", "Área importante para aves migratorias"],
